/*
 * Terminal emulator using VDI routines
 *
 * Eric S Fraga
 * 1986 March 4
 * Revision: 1986 July 10 -- converted to use a window and menu bar
 *
 * Based on a window demo:
 *
 *****************************************************
 * Window demo					     *
 * by Jerome M. Lang   21 February 1986	             *
 * PD						     *
